{
  "title": "Dua for rejuvenating the Hearts",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is quoted from al-Mujtana, a man is reported to have seen the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) in dream and asked him to teach him a supplicatory prayer that would refresh his heart. Therefore, the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) taught him these words:\nيَا حَىُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ،يَا لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ اَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تُحْيِىَ قَلْبِىْۤ،اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nYAA HAYYO YAA QAYYOOMO, YAA LAA ELAAHA ILLAAA ANTA AS-ALOKA AN TOHYEYA QALBEE, ALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Ever-Living, O Self-Sustaining, O You besides Whom there is no god; I ask You to give life to my heart. O Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad.\nThe man commented, “When I repeated these words three times, Almighty Allah refreshed my heart.”"
}
